species_type = 6
creature_name = "Scarecrow"
species_desc = "A grinning jack-o-lantern peers into your soul, eagerly awaiting for you to smash it to pieces.

It sways uncannily on its own volition, but nonetheless seems to be friendly enough.

It is said that jack-o-lanterns keep evil spirits at bay."

